{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24814","headline":"赋花 · 王起","name":"赋花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花，点缀，分葩。\n露初裛，月未斜。\n一枝曲水，千树山家。\n戏蝶未成梦，娇莺语更夸。\n既见东园成径，何殊西子同车。\n渐觉风飘轻似雪，能令醉者乱如麻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}